usage: harness models [-h] [--limit LIMIT] [--all] [--out OUT] [--quiet]
                      [--events FILE] [--no-color]

options:
  -h, --help     show this help message and exit
  --limit LIMIT
  --all          list all live models, not just free
  --out OUT
  --quiet        suppress stderr progress notes; report only
  --events FILE  append typed JSONL progress events to FILE (UI telemetry; the
                 JSON result is unchanged)
  --no-color     disable ANSI color in stderr rendering (NO_COLOR is honored
                 too)
